import equational_theories.Definability.ExactAut4D4

/-!
# Structural certificate sources: `Magma.exactD4`

For each of the following magmas, drawn from the `14` magmas on `Fin 4` whose automorphism group is
exactly the order-`8` group of `Magma.permED4`, the equations it satisfies that no earlier listed
magma does. Together they are the `1322` equations that are worth using as the *source* `L'` of a
`Magma.exactD4` certificate -- the rest have such a model too, but the resulting facts are already
implied by what is on the board. `6` members cover them.

This file is generated; see the module docstring of `Definability.ExactAut4`.
-/

set_option maxHeartbeats 1000000
-- each `rfl` below reads one entry out of `Magma.memArrD4`, and reading entry `k` recurses `k`
-- deep into the list behind the array
set_option maxRecDepth 100000

